1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Hi, little friends! I'm Kiki.

2
00:00:03,799 --> 00:00:09,699
Today the storybook opened to a page... Huh?

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,219
This page is so weird! It has a rabbit... wearing a vest?

4
00:00:16,519 --> 00:00:22,899
The storybook showed a little white rabbit in a red vest, holding a golden pocket watch.

5
00:00:23,199 --> 00:00:28,939
Suddenly, the picture came to life! The rabbit jumped right out of the book!

6
00:00:29,239 --> 00:00:32,500
I'm late! I'm late! I'm going to be late!

7
00:00:32,799 --> 00:00:37,819
Wow! A talking rabbit! Wait for me!

8
00:00:38,119 --> 00:00:43,939
Kiki chased the white rabbit, running through the story house, past the little garden.

9
00:00:44,239 --> 00:00:48,139
Late, late, late! The Queen of Hearts will be so angry!

10
00:00:48,439 --> 00:00:53,379
The white rabbit ducked into a small hole. Kiki followed right after.

11
00:00:53,679 --> 00:00:56,379
Whooooa!

12
00:00:56,679 --> 00:01:01,939
Kiki started falling down, down, down, like the longest slide ever!

13
00:01:02,239 --> 00:01:09,499
As she fell, strange things floated by — books, clocks, teacups, and playing cards!

14
00:01:09,799 --> 00:01:14,019
So amazing! Everything is flying!

15
00:01:14,319 --> 00:01:19,259
Kiki reached out to grab a flying book, but it was just too far.

16
00:01:19,559 --> 00:01:25,139
She fell for a long, long time... until finally — plop!

17
00:01:25,439 --> 00:01:28,139
Kiki landed softly on a bed of flowers.

18
00:01:28,439 --> 00:01:31,139
Wow, so pretty!

19
00:01:31,439 --> 00:01:39,339
Flowers everywhere! Red flowers, purple flowers, blue flowers, filling a long hallway.

20
00:01:39,639 --> 00:01:42,899
But where was the white rabbit? He was gone.

21
00:01:43,199 --> 00:01:48,139
White Rabbit? Where did you go?

22
00:01:48,439 --> 00:01:57,059
At the end of the hallway, there was a tiny little door. Behind it, something seemed to be waiting.

23
00:01:57,359 --> 00:02:03,579
Have you ever done something fun just because you were curious?

24
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:08,259
Tell Kiki in the comments!

25
00:02:08,559 --> 00:02:18,539
Next time, Kiki finds a bottle that says "Drink Me" and a cake that says "Eat Me"!

26
00:02:18,839 --> 00:02:20,899
What will happen?

27
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:24,379
Good night, see you tomorrow~ 🌈

